{"w":2400,"h":3106,"lines":[{"c":1,"y":0.067680225519992754,"x":0.78178249994921223,"t":"Introduction","w":0.11312672932942702,"h":0.020162804696303605},{"x":0.095864664619556714,"y":0.12063953460744625,"w":0.30827067057291663,"t":"HOW IS IELTS SCORED?","h":0.015988372635703296,"c":1},{"w":0.79710652669270821,"h":0.019397124580928571,"c":1,"x":0.092051759447644391,"y":0.15661223632824128,"t":"IELTS results are reported on a nine-band scale. In addition to the score for overall language"},{"c":1,"h":0.017458706921481104,"x":0.093984950083394567,"y":0.17732558126429154,"w":0.76691731770833327,"t":"ability, IELTS provides a score in the form of a profile for each of the four skills (Listening,"},{"c":1,"h":0.017707662588538287,"x":0.093984968812577369,"y":0.19607211822116422,"t":"Reading, Writing and Speaking). These scores are also reported on a nine-band scale. All","w":0.78007517496744794},{"x":0.09390801741418045,"t":"scores are recorded on the Test Report Form along with details of the candidate's nationality,","w":0.79906672159830727,"c":1,"h":0.022076035037166597,"y":0.21052772274253784},{"c":1,"x":0.092068579089695776,"h":0.018675925112968228,"y":0.23149602067237773,"t":"first language and date of birth. Each Overall Band Score corresponds to a descriptive","w":0.74256220499674475},{"w":0.79338841756184897,"c":1,"h":0.019641091419816847,"x":0.093916584769903763,"t":"statement which gives a summary of the English language ability of a candidate classified at","y":0.24980878306492116},{"c":1,"x":0.093921550632682954,"w":0.63358271280924483,"t":"that level. The nine bands and their descriptive statements are as follows:","y":0.26869645786005236,"h":0.018729428514233759},{"w":0.79709589640299494,"x":0.093939710943936064,"y":0.31683950918116444,"t":"9 Expert User - Has fully operational command of the language: appropriate, accurate and","h":0.021631082410744851,"c":1},{"t":"fluent with complete understanding.","x":0.11842105281475729,"y":0.33708950446559305,"w":0.31015037536621093,"h":0.016108170218876117,"c":1},{"t":"8 Very Good User - Has fully operational command of the language with only occasional","y":0.36769581309195754,"w":0.78211415608723955,"c":1,"x":0.093911277088994508,"h":0.021145967384038733},{"w":0.69360900878906251,"x":0.12030075870733403,"h":0.017707662588538287,"c":1,"y":0.38795878942215878,"t":"unsystematic inaccuracies and inappropriacies. Misunderstandings may occur in"},{"y":0.406954281903532,"t":"unfamiliar situations. Handles complex detailed argumentation well.","w":0.57894734700520833,"h":0.016097875080489321,"c":1,"x":0.1203007624971409},{"t":"7 Good User - Has operational command of the language, though with occasional","x":0.093935277296677763,"y":0.43748083356959566,"h":0.021426443430353381,"w":0.72379704793294275,"c":1},{"w":0.714390869140625,"h":0.019159531946421726,"c":1,"y":0.45640450374935737,"x":0.12024872172229427,"t":"inaccuracies, inappropriacies and misunderstandings in some situations. Generally"},{"t":"handles complex language well and understands detailed reasoning.","x":0.12030075967336544,"y":0.47520927213022246,"h":0.01752328596342323,"c":1,"w":0.59210525512695322},{"t":"6 Competent User - Has generally effective command of the language despite some","h":0.018895348808647294,"x":0.093984971170173903,"y":0.50726744163855431,"w":0.7462405904134114,"c":1},{"w":0.73130849202473958,"t":"inaccuracies, inappropriacies and misunderstandings. Can use and understand fairly","y":0.52549405388551107,"h":0.019840472602721482,"x":0.11836752796601804,"c":1},{"t":"complex language, particularly in familiar situations.","w":0.44548873901367186,"h":0.017707662588538398,"y":0.54636188002691954,"c":1,"x":0.12030074319234814},{"x":0.093941955693913906,"h":0.020009389632913432,"y":0.57700538965787151,"t":"5 Modest User - Has partial command of the language, coping with overall meaning in","c":1,"w":0.7594926961263021},{"c":1,"h":0.019682209950758423,"x":0.11835642495519134,"w":0.75765879313151041,"y":0.59503536221081677,"t":"most situations, though is likely to make many mistakes. Should be able to handle basic"},{"x":0.120300752998259,"c":1,"h":0.016097875080489432,"y":0.61622665792721976,"t":"communication in own field.","w":0.24060150146484377},{"c":1,"h":0.019005787733364254,"y":0.64680232558851913,"t":"4 Limited User - Basic competence is limited to familiar situations. Has frequent problems","x":0.092105263056394715,"w":0.79323308308919271},{"w":0.61090225219726557,"c":1,"h":0.017496144011645565,"x":0.11842105523416345,"t":"in understanding and expression. Is not able to use complex language.","y":0.66569767424854698},{"y":0.69896973569001952,"t":"3 Extremely Limited User - Conveys and understands only general meaning in very","w":0.74436091105143232,"h":0.017707662588538287,"c":1,"x":0.09398495800599449},{"t":"familiar situations. Frequent breakdowns in communication occur.","h":0.016097875080489321,"y":0.71796522878641611,"c":1,"x":0.11842104449800103,"w":0.56578948974609378},{"t":"2 Intermittent User - No real communication is possible except for the most basic","x":0.093984965852927468,"y":0.74999999972433873,"c":1,"w":0.72180450439453125,"h":0.015988372635703296},{"h":0.021099295680628849,"c":1,"x":0.11831548750450366,"t":"information using isolated words or short formulae in familiar situations and to meet","w":0.71827529907226562,"y":0.76599812345559692},{"x":0.11834189626588919,"h":0.02114649549731118,"c":1,"t":"immediate needs. Has great difficulty understanding spoken and written English.","w":0.693756103515625,"y":0.78578165219884821},{"h":0.017505503284186652,"t":"1 Non User - Essentially has no ability to use the language beyond possibly a few isolated","w":0.7951127624511718,"x":0.092105272815991179,"y":0.81970379916784775,"c":1},{"t":"words.","x":0.12012336083372185,"h":0.014290896217360904,"c":1,"w":0.060703334808349607,"y":0.839776221687762},{"y":0.87057308459029303,"c":1,"h":0.017508310881723332,"w":0.58082707722981763,"t":"0 Did not attempt the test - No assessable information provided.","x":0.093984957612430933},{"c":1,"t":"7","y":0.97674418612532232,"h":0.014534883321060788,"x":0.87593984963310823,"w":0.015037593841552788}]}